content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Freelancer",
      "description": "Independent worker offering services"
    },
    {
      "name": "Profile",
      "description": "Freelancer Profile showing skills and experience",
      "attributes": [
        "Skill",
        "Experience"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Skill",
      "description": "Freelancer capability or expertise"
    },
    {
      "name": "Experience",
      "description": "Freelancer past work background"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Proposal",
      "description": "Freelancer submission for a project",
      "attributes": [
        "Deadline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Deadline",
      "description": "Time by which work must be completed"
    },
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Person posting projects and hiring freelancers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Description",
      "description": "Client description of required work"
    },
    {
      "name": "Completed Work",
      "description": "Finished work delivered for a project"
    },
    {
      "name": "Contact",
      "description": "Communication exchange between Client and Freelancer"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Client evaluation of Completed Work",
      "attributes": [
        "Completed Work"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "description": "Money paid for Completed Work",
      "attributes": [
        "Completed Work"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform Manager",
      "description": "Administrator overseeing platform activity"
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform Guidelines",
      "description": "Rules for acceptable platform use"
    },
    {
      "name": "Verification",
      "description": "Platform Manager review of submissions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Dispute Report",
      "description": "Complaint raised about a conflict"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name the two related objects and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Freelancer",
      "to": "Profile",
      "description": "Freelancer creates Profile"
    },
    {
      "from": "Freelancer",
      "to": "Project Proposal",
      "description": "Freelancer submits Project Proposal"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Project Description",
      "description": "Client posts Project Description"
    },
    {
      "from": "Project Description",
      "to": "Project Proposal",
      "description": "Project Description receives Project Proposal"
    },
    {
      "from": "Freelancer",
      "to": "Contact",
      "description": "Freelancer sends Contact message"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Contact",
      "description": "Client sends Contact message"
    },
    {
      "from": "Freelancer",
      "to": "Completed Work",
      "description": "Freelancer produces Completed Work"
    },
    {
      "from": "Completed Work",
      "to": "Client",
      "description": "Completed Work is delivered to Client"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Feedback",
      "description": "Client gives Feedback"
    },
    {
      "from": "Feedback",
      "to": "Freelancer",
      "description": "Feedback is shown to Freelancer"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Payment",
      "description": "Client issues Payment"
    },
    {
      "from": "Payment",
      "to": "Freelancer",
      "description": "Payment is transferred to Freelancer"
    },
    {
      "from": "Platform Manager",
      "to": "Payment",
      "description": "Platform Manager monitors Payment"
    },
    {
      "from": "Platform Manager",
      "to": "Verification",
      "description": "Platform Manager performs Verification"
    },
    {
      "from": "Verification",
      "to": "Project Proposal",
      "description": "Verification checks Project Proposal"
    },
    {
      "from": "Platform Manager",
      "to": "Platform Guidelines",
      "description": "Platform Manager enforces Platform Guidelines"
    },
    {
      "from": "Platform Manager",
      "to": "Dispute Report",
      "description": "Platform Manager files Dispute Report"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Dispute Report",
      "description": "Client submits Dispute Report"
    },
    {
      "from": "Freelancer",
      "to": "Dispute Report",
      "description": "Freelancer submits Dispute Report"
    }
  ]
}
```
